# Public Mux Playback ID (Mux dashboard -> Video -> Assets -> your asset -> Playback ID).
# The asset's playback policy must be "public". Copy this file to .env.local and set your own ID.
# If this is not set, the public Mux demo asset is used so the project still plays.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MUX_PLAYBACK_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_VIDEO_TITLE=Aether Obsidian
